comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-20T19:27:47.107Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: exact keyword search OSV audit found only the completed component fixes. Full live records for both closed leaves and the security parent distinguish independent-feed freshness from package-version remediation. Current open and in-progress inventories show no exact active owner. Intake only: open and unclaimed; this does not represent an unresolved affected dependency in the patched graph."
  "2026-10-20T20:19:39.904Z","harness:codex","Implementation: fresh Scorecard at e4f5f10 identified two additional advisories published during prior review. Collect every pnpm-lock packages entry against OSV plus the unchanged all-severity registry audit; persist lock/input hashes, per-source retrieval times, coverage, availability, and explicit unknown database freshness. A repository-quality SDK provider verifies the bounded local receipt with no network. Missing, stale, incomplete, failed, or positive evidence blocks. New component remediation is pm-5sgx37."
  "2026-10-20T20:26:20.512Z","harness:codex","Implemented repository-owned collector plus local-only assurance provider. All 53 focused regression cases pass with exact new-source coverage: lines 98/98, statements 110/110, functions 23/23, branches 56/56. Complete-lock negative control observed OSV positives with registry zero; patched client/core 2.3.0 and Vite 7.3.7 now return zero across all 569 locked packages. Both registry and independent source availability remain explicit; database freshness is unknown. Source qualification and hosted review are still pending."
